note """serialization fixture: the gob escape hatch. Escaped supplies GobEncode on its value receiver and GobDecode on its pointer, over a struct that carries a chan. The hatch suppresses the STRUCTURAL walk of the type it sits on — the chan is no longer a drop, because the type owns its own bytes — and suppresses NOTHING about registration, so the state entry still needs one."""
flow Screening (Escaped) -> ok Escaped
state {
  tally Escaped
}
transform ok Compute from in
sink store Save from ok
